! TDDFT mode matrix 12/16 -- triplet block alone
!
! Cases 01-05 request singlets, case 06 requests both; this one asks
! for triplets ONLY, which is the branch where first_block is still
! .true. when the triplet assembly starts.  A bug that initializes
! shared state in the singlet pass would survive cases 01-06 and die
! only here.
%method  B3LYP
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%charge  0
%mult    1
%tddft   3
%tddft_multiplicity triplet
%geom angstrom
O    0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
H    0.000000    0.757200   -0.469200
H    0.000000   -0.757200   -0.469200
*end
